      "clozeText": "I am very excited about my new secondary school. In the morning, I put on my neat school (23) ________ and walk to school with my best friend. Our classroom is on the second floor and has thirty wooden (24) ________. During break time, we often go to the school (25) ________ to read scientific magazines. The teachers are helpful and always (26) ________ us patiently. I feel really (27) ________ to study here.",
      "readingText": "An Giang Secondary School is a famous boarding school in the Mekong Delta. More than five hundred students study and live here during weekdays.\n\nThe school has modern facilities, including twenty large classrooms, two computer labs, and a well-equipped science laboratory. Outside, there is an expansive sports field where students play football and badminton every afternoon. All students wear their dark blue uniforms from Monday to Friday.\n\nLiving at a boarding school helps students become independent and responsible. They learn how to wash their own clothes, tidy their bedrooms, and manage their daily study schedule. In the evening, teachers organize study sessions to help students with difficult exercises. An Giang Secondary School provides a warm community that prepares students well for the future.",
