      "audioScript": "Teacher: Good morning, class 6C. Welcome to your first science lab session.\nStudents: Good morning, Mr. Binh!\nTeacher: Before we begin our experiment with liquids, please remember three essential safety rules. First, you must always wear protective plastic goggles over your eyes.\nSecond, never taste or smell any chemical solutions directly with your nose.\nThird, if you accidentally break a glass test tube, do not touch it with your bare hands. Inform me immediately.\nStudents: Yes, Mr. Binh. We understand clearly.\nTeacher: Excellent. Please put on your white lab coats and stand by your workstations.",
      "clozeText": "Lan lives with her parents in a high-rise apartment building in Hanoi. Their flat is on the tenth (23) ________ with a wonderful view of the city. There are two bedrooms, a bright living room and a modern (24) ________ with a big fridge. Her parents bought a soft (25) ________ for the living room floor. Lan shares her bedroom with her younger sister, and they (26) ________ their room every weekend. She loves her cozy (27) ________ very much.",
      "readingText": "Minh has been my closest classmate since our first day in secondary school. He is a tall boy with a round face, bright dark eyes, and a very warm smile.\n\nMinh is extremely hard-working and always finishes all homework before going to bed. His favourite subject is mathematics because he loves solving challenging geometry puzzles. Whenever our classmates struggle with difficult exercises, Minh patiently sits down and explains the formulas step by step. He never shows impatience or arrogance toward anyone.\n\nIn addition to academic excellence, Minh is also an enthusiastic swimmer. Every Saturday morning, we cycle together to the district sports club for swimming practice. Minh dreams of becoming a computer engineer who creates educational games for children. I am truly proud to have such a reliable and kind-hearted friend.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLan lives with her parents in a high-rise apartment building in Hanoi. Their flat is on the tenth (23) ________ with a wonderful view of the city. There are two bedrooms, a bright living room and a modern (24) ________ with a big fridge. Her parents bought a soft (25) ________ for the living room floor. Lan shares her bedroom with her younger sister, and they (26) ________ their room every weekend. She loves her cozy (27) ________ very much.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMinh has been my closest classmate since our first day in secondary school. He is a tall boy with a round face, bright dark eyes, and a very warm smile.\n\nMinh is extremely hard-working and always finishes all homework before going to bed. His favourite subject is mathematics because he loves solving challenging geometry puzzles. Whenever our classmates struggle with difficult exercises, Minh patiently sits down and explains the formulas step by step. He never shows impatience or arrogance toward anyone.\n\nIn addition to academic excellence, Minh is also an enthusiastic swimmer. Every Saturday morning, we cycle together to the district sports club for swimming practice. Minh dreams of becoming a computer engineer who creates educational games for children. I am truly proud to have such a reliable and kind-hearted friend.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): You should write about: What time you wake up and get ready; How you travel to school; Your favourite lessons in the morning; Activities during recess and after school.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
