      "audioScript": "The head cook at our school canteen introduced a new balanced menu this Monday. The lunch tray includes brown rice, steamed chicken breast, boiled broccoli, and pumpkin soup. Students also receive a fresh red apple for dessert. Good nutrition helps us concentrate during afternoon lessons.",
      "clozeText": "Phong has a special talent for fine arts. His sketches of old streets and trees are very (23) ________ and full of life. Whenever he gets a new box of coloured pencils, he spends hours (24) ________ in his notebook. He is a rather (25) ________ boy who does not talk much in large crowds. However, with his close friends, he is humorous and (26) ________. His art teacher thinks he can become a professional (27) ________ in the future.",
      "readingText": "To improve communicative fluency, our school established an outdoor English Speaking Corner under the shaded courtyard trees.\n\nEvery Tuesday and Thursday morning, students gather freely around round wooden tables to converse in English. Foreign volunteer teachers often visit the corner to introduce entertaining games, pronunciation drills, and cultural discussions about life in the UK, Australia, and Canada.\n\nStudents are encouraged to express their ideas openly without fearing grammatical errors. This relaxed environment has noticeably boosted students' confidence and listening comprehension skills.",
