      "clozeText": "My uncle owns a spacious villa on the outskirts of Da Lat city. The villa is surrounded by high pine trees and colourful flower (23) ________. Inside, there is a large open-plan living room with huge glass (24) ________ that let in plenty of natural sunlight. In the evening, the family gathers around the stone fireplace because the mountain air gets quite (25) ________. The kitchen has modern appliances like an oven and a dish (26) ________. It is a wonderful place to (27) ________ during vacations.",
