      "clozeText": "Last Sunday, I decided to rearrange all the furniture in my bedroom to make it more spacious. First, I pushed my single bed against the left (23) ________. Then, I placed my study table under the window so I can get natural (24) ________ while doing homework. Next, I hung a colourful world map and family photos on the empty (25) ________. My mother helped me clean the floor and wash the blue (26) ________. Now my bedroom looks fresh, bright, and very (27) ________.",
