      "clozeText": "Cycling to school every morning provides an ideal combination of physical exercise and environmental protection. Riding a bicycle for twenty minutes activates major leg muscle groups, boosts cardiovascular stamina, and stimulates mental alertness before classes. Moreover, choosing bicycles instead of motorbikes eliminates exhaust emissions, directly contributing to cleaner urban air. Our school has constructed a secure bicycle shelter to encourage students to commute green. Cycling with classmates also makes the daily journey to school lively and cheerful.",
