      "audioScript": "Tom: \"Hi Linh! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLinh: \"Hello Tom! I am preparing a short talk about Managing Academic Stress among Grade 8 Students.\"\nTom: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLinh: \"Sure! Transitioning into grade 8 introduces students to higher academic expectations and increasingly demanding curriculum content.\"\nTom: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLinh: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning into grade 8 introduces students to higher (23) ________ expectations and increasingly demanding curriculum content. Many teenagers experience heightened anxiety regarding term examinations, (24) ________ tests, and parental expectations. Psychologists emphasize that chronic stress can impair memory retention and (25) ________ emotional instability. To manage pressure constructively, students should cultivate structured study timetables, practice deep-breathing (26) ________, and engage in open communication with school counsellors. Remember that true success (27) ________ in continuous effort rather than flawless perfection.",
      "readingText": "Transitioning into grade 8 introduces students to higher academic expectations and increasingly demanding curriculum content. Many teenagers experience heightened anxiety regarding term examinations, standardized tests, and parental expectations. Psychologists emphasize that chronic stress can impair memory retention and trigger emotional instability. To manage pressure constructively, students should cultivate structured study timetables, practice deep-breathing exercises, and engage in open communication with school counsellors. Remember that true success lies in continuous effort rather than flawless perfection.",
