      "clozeText": "Making DIY crafts from discarded household items is a (23) ________ and eco-friendly hobby embraced by many young environmentalists. Instead of throwing away empty plastic bottles, (24) ________ can transform them into decorative hanging flower planters. The process involves cutting bottles in half, smoothing (25) ________ plastic edges with sandpaper, and punching drainage holes in the bottom. After painting vibrant animal (26) ________ with waterproof acrylics, you can plant trailing ivy or succulent cacti. This creative (27) ________ reduces landfill waste while beautifying your study room.",
