      "audioScript": "Peter: \"Hi An! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nAn: \"Hello Peter! I am preparing a short talk about The Peaceful Charm of Countryside Life.\"\nPeter: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nAn: \"Sure! Life in rural Vietnamese villages moves at a tranquil and unhurried pace compared to congested urban centers.\"\nPeter: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nAn: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Life in rural Vietnamese villages moves at a tranquil and (23) ________ pace compared to congested urban centers. Villagers wake early to the cheerful crowing of roosters, (24) ________ vegetable gardens and feeding domestic poultry before sunrise. Village lanes are bordered by green bamboo groves (25) ________ fragrant lotus ponds rather than concrete skyscrapers and exhaust fumes. Neighbours know each other intimately, always (26) ________ to lend assistance during community festivities or house repairs. The genuine warmth and hospitality (27) ________ countryside folk leave an indelible impression on visitors.",
      "readingText": "Life in rural Vietnamese villages moves at a tranquil and unhurried pace compared to congested urban centers. Villagers wake early to the cheerful crowing of roosters, tending vegetable gardens and feeding domestic poultry before sunrise. Village lanes are bordered by green bamboo groves and fragrant lotus ponds rather than concrete skyscrapers and exhaust fumes. Neighbours know each other intimately, always ready to lend assistance during community festivities or house repairs. The genuine warmth and hospitality of countryside folk leave an indelible impression on visitors.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLife in rural Vietnamese villages moves at a tranquil and (23) ________ pace compared to congested urban centers. Villagers wake early to the cheerful crowing of roosters, (24) ________ vegetable gardens and feeding domestic poultry before sunrise. Village lanes are bordered by green bamboo groves (25) ________ fragrant lotus ponds rather than concrete skyscrapers and exhaust fumes. Neighbours know each other intimately, always (26) ________ to lend assistance during community festivities or house repairs. The genuine warmth and hospitality (27) ________ countryside folk leave an indelible impression on visitors.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLife in rural Vietnamese villages moves at a tranquil and unhurried pace compared to congested urban centers. Villagers wake early to the cheerful crowing of roosters, tending vegetable gardens and feeding domestic poultry before sunrise. Village lanes are bordered by green bamboo groves and fragrant lotus ponds rather than concrete skyscrapers and exhaust fumes. Neighbours know each other intimately, always ready to lend assistance during community festivities or house repairs. The genuine warmth and hospitality of countryside folk leave an indelible impression on visitors.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Pace of life, environment, and air quality; Relationships between neighbours; Transport and facilities; Which lifestyle you prefer and why.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
