      "clozeText": "Kite flying has been a cherished traditional folk pastime in (23) ________ Noi village for countless generations. Village artisans construct giant crescent-shaped kites using resilient bamboo frames, (24) ________ handmade dó paper, and calibrated wooden whistles called sáo diều. When hoisted high into the breezy (25) ________ sky, these flute kites emit hauntingly melodious harmonies that resonate across miles of rice fields. Whole (26) ________ gather on dykes at sunset to listen to the enchanting sky music. This artistic (27) ________ hobby bridges past heritage with contemporary community joy.",
      "readingText": "Kite flying has been a cherished traditional folk pastime in Duong Noi village for countless generations. Village artisans construct giant crescent-shaped kites using resilient bamboo frames, coated handmade dó paper, and calibrated wooden whistles called sáo diều. When hoisted high into the breezy evening sky, these flute kites emit hauntingly melodious harmonies that resonate across miles of rice fields. Whole villages gather on dykes at sunset to listen to the enchanting sky music. This artistic folk hobby bridges past heritage with contemporary community joy.",
