      "schoolName": "TRƯỜNG THCS ĐỒNG YÊN",
      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_gk1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: \"Hi Trang! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nTrang: \"Hello Ben! I am preparing a short talk about Nomadic Life in the Central Highlands.\"\nBen: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nTrang: \"Sure! Living on the sweeping plateaus of the Central Highlands offers an extraordinary encounter with nomadic and semi-nomadic traditions.\"\nBen: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nTrang: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Living on the sweeping plateaus of the Central Highlands offers (23) ________ extraordinary encounter with nomadic and semi-nomadic traditions. Ethnic minority communities like the Ede and Gia (24) ________ maintain deep spiritual connections with nature, residing in communal longhouses built on solid timber pillars. Buffalo (25) ________ roam freely across vast savannahs, guided by agile young cattle herders on horseback. In the evening, (26) ________ gather around ceremonial gongs to sing ancestral epics under starlit skies. The boundless freedom (27) ________ communal solidarity of highland life inspire deep reverence.",
      "readingText": "Living on the sweeping plateaus of the Central Highlands offers an extraordinary encounter with nomadic and semi-nomadic traditions. Ethnic minority communities like the Ede and Gia Rai maintain deep spiritual connections with nature, residing in communal longhouses built on solid timber pillars. Buffalo herds roam freely across vast savannahs, guided by agile young cattle herders on horseback. In the evening, villagers gather around ceremonial gongs to sing ancestral epics under starlit skies. The boundless freedom and communal solidarity of highland life inspire deep reverence.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLiving on the sweeping plateaus of the Central Highlands offers (23) ________ extraordinary encounter with nomadic and semi-nomadic traditions. Ethnic minority communities like the Ede and Gia (24) ________ maintain deep spiritual connections with nature, residing in communal longhouses built on solid timber pillars. Buffalo (25) ________ roam freely across vast savannahs, guided by agile young cattle herders on horseback. In the evening, (26) ________ gather around ceremonial gongs to sing ancestral epics under starlit skies. The boundless freedom (27) ________ communal solidarity of highland life inspire deep reverence.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLiving on the sweeping plateaus of the Central Highlands offers an extraordinary encounter with nomadic and semi-nomadic traditions. Ethnic minority communities like the Ede and Gia Rai maintain deep spiritual connections with nature, residing in communal longhouses built on solid timber pillars. Buffalo herds roam freely across vast savannahs, guided by agile young cattle herders on horseback. In the evening, villagers gather around ceremonial gongs to sing ancestral epics under starlit skies. The boundless freedom and communal solidarity of highland life inspire deep reverence.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): How nomadic families live in yurts; Daily chores (herding cattle, riding horses); Connection with vast nature; What modern youth can learn from nomads.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
