      "audioScript": "Tom: \"Hi Linh! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLinh: \"Hello Tom! I am preparing a short talk about Morning Fishing on the Mekong River.\"\nTom: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLinh: \"Sure! At first light, the Mekong River awakens to the gentle chugging of wooden long-tail boats heading towards early fishing grounds.\"\nTom: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLinh: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "At first light, the Mekong River awakens to the gentle (23) ________ of wooden long-tail boats heading towards early fishing grounds. Fishermen cast sweeping nylon throw-nets across golden (24) ________ currents with rhythmic grace, capturing freshwater silver carp and river prawns. The river breeze is cool (25) ________ crisp, carrying the sweet scent of blooming water hyacinths. For local teenagers, joining family fishing excursions (26) ________ aquatic safety, patience, and a deep understanding of river ecology. The river is not merely (27) ________ waterway; it is the vital lifeline sustaining millions.",
      "readingText": "At first light, the Mekong River awakens to the gentle chugging of wooden long-tail boats heading towards early fishing grounds. Fishermen cast sweeping nylon throw-nets across golden river currents with rhythmic grace, capturing freshwater silver carp and river prawns. The river breeze is cool and crisp, carrying the sweet scent of blooming water hyacinths. For local teenagers, joining family fishing excursions teaches aquatic safety, patience, and a deep understanding of river ecology. The river is not merely a waterway; it is the vital lifeline sustaining millions.",
