      "audioScript": "Peter: \"Hi An! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nAn: \"Hello Peter! I am preparing a short talk about Knitting and Textile Crafts for Mental Calm.\"\nPeter: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nAn: \"Sure! Knitting and crochet have witnessed a remarkable resurgence among modern teenagers who appreciate slow, intentional crafting.\"\nPeter: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nAn: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Knitting and crochet have witnessed a remarkable resurgence among (23) ________ teenagers who appreciate slow, intentional crafting. The rhythmic, repetitive motion of looping woollen yarn over (24) ________ wooden needles induces a meditative mental calm similar to mindfulness yoga. Crafting handmade beanies, mittens, (25) ________ plush amigurumi toys requires focus on stitch counts and tension balance. Completing a wearable (26) ________ piece delivers a deep sense of creative accomplishment. This peaceful hobby proves that analog (27) ________ remain timelessly rewarding in our fast-moving world.",
