      "audioScript": "David: \"Hi Huong! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nHuong: \"Hello David! I am preparing a short talk about A Day at a Traditional Floating Market.\"\nDavid: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nHuong: \"Sure! Cai Rang floating market in Can Tho presents an intoxicating explosion of vibrant sights, sounds, and aromas.\"\nDavid: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nHuong: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Cai Rang floating market in Can Tho presents an intoxicating (23) ________ of vibrant sights, sounds, and aromas. Hundreds of wooden boats loaded with heaps of pineapples, watermelons, (24) ________ mangoes cluster along the river at dawn. Each boat displays its agricultural goods on a tall (25) ________ pole called a cây bẹo so buyers can see offerings from afar. Breakfast vendors weave skillfully (26) ________ the flotilla, serving steaming bowls of hu tieu noodles directly across boat gunwales. Experiencing (27) ________ lively floating commerce provides an unforgettable cultural encounter.",
      "readingText": "Cai Rang floating market in Can Tho presents an intoxicating explosion of vibrant sights, sounds, and aromas. Hundreds of wooden boats loaded with heaps of pineapples, watermelons, and mangoes cluster along the river at dawn. Each boat displays its agricultural goods on a tall bamboo pole called a cây bẹo so buyers can see offerings from afar. Breakfast vendors weave skillfully through the flotilla, serving steaming bowls of hu tieu noodles directly across boat gunwales. Experiencing this lively floating commerce provides an unforgettable cultural encounter.",
