      "audioScript": "Phong: \"Hi Lan! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLan: \"Hello Phong! I am preparing a short talk about Exploring Ancient Caves in Quang Binh.\"\nPhong: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLan: \"Sure! Quang Binh province is world-renowned as the subterranean cave capital of planet Earth.\"\nPhong: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLan: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Quang Binh province is world-renowned as the subterranean (23) ________ capital of planet Earth. Joining a guided eco-expedition through limestone caverns reveals surreal subterranean (24) ________ shaped over millions of years. Hikers traverse crystal-clear underground rivers, marvel at colossal (25) ________ rising like cathedral pillars, and observe rare blind cave fish. Trekking through the (26) ________, pristine darkness demands teamwork, athletic endurance, and strict adherence to conservation guidelines. (27) ________ caves instills deep reverence for geological time.",
      "readingText": "Quang Binh province is world-renowned as the subterranean cave capital of planet Earth. Joining a guided eco-expedition through limestone caverns reveals surreal subterranean landscapes shaped over millions of years. Hikers traverse crystal-clear underground rivers, marvel at colossal stalagmites rising like cathedral pillars, and observe rare blind cave fish. Trekking through the cool, pristine darkness demands teamwork, athletic endurance, and strict adherence to conservation guidelines. Exploring caves instills deep reverence for geological time.",
