      "audioScript": "Tom: \"Hi Linh! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLinh: \"Hello Tom! I am preparing a short talk about Building Self-Confidence through Public Speaking.\"\nTom: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLinh: \"Sure! Public speaking is frequently ranked as one of the greatest fears confronting young adolescents.\"\nTom: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLinh: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Public speaking is frequently ranked as one of (23) ________ greatest fears confronting young adolescents. The trembling voice, racing heartbeat, and fear of making (24) ________ can feel overwhelming when standing before an audience. However, joining public speaking workshops helps (25) ________ overcome stage fright systematically through vocal warm-ups and positive visualization. Delivering a persuasive speech (26) ________ enthusiastic applause builds unshakeable self-esteem and communicative poise. Overcoming the fear of (27) ________ unlocks boundless potential in every young person.",
      "readingText": "Public speaking is frequently ranked as one of the greatest fears confronting young adolescents. The trembling voice, racing heartbeat, and fear of making mistakes can feel overwhelming when standing before an audience. However, joining public speaking workshops helps teenagers overcome stage fright systematically through vocal warm-ups and positive visualization. Delivering a persuasive speech to enthusiastic applause builds unshakeable self-esteem and communicative poise. Overcoming the fear of speaking unlocks boundless potential in every young person.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPublic speaking is frequently ranked as one of (23) ________ greatest fears confronting young adolescents. The trembling voice, racing heartbeat, and fear of making (24) ________ can feel overwhelming when standing before an audience. However, joining public speaking workshops helps (25) ________ overcome stage fright systematically through vocal warm-ups and positive visualization. Delivering a persuasive speech (26) ________ enthusiastic applause builds unshakeable self-esteem and communicative poise. Overcoming the fear of (27) ________ unlocks boundless potential in every young person.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nPublic speaking is frequently ranked as one of the greatest fears confronting young adolescents. The trembling voice, racing heartbeat, and fear of making mistakes can feel overwhelming when standing before an audience. However, joining public speaking workshops helps teenagers overcome stage fright systematically through vocal warm-ups and positive visualization. Delivering a persuasive speech to enthusiastic applause builds unshakeable self-esteem and communicative poise. Overcoming the fear of speaking unlocks boundless potential in every young person.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Difficulties faced by street animals; Practical rescue actions (feeding, medical treatment, fostering); Developing empathy and community responsibility.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
