      "audioScript": "Nam: \"Hi Mai! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nMai: \"Hello Nam! I am preparing a short talk about Preserving the Conical Hat Craft in Chuong Village.\"\nNam: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nMai: \"Sure! Nestled along the Day River in Hanoi, Chuong village has long been celebrated for its exquisite conical palm hats, or nón lá.\"\nNam: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nMai: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Nestled along the Day River in Hanoi, Chuong village has long (23) ________ celebrated for its exquisite conical palm hats, or nón lá. Local artisans have passed down their delicate (24) ________ through countless generations. Crafting a high-quality conical hat demands intricate skill: selecting pale green young palm leaves, ironing (25) ________ flat with hot charcoal irons, and stitching them with nylon thread onto sixteen circular bamboo hoops. Despite (26) ________ influx of modern caps and sunhats, young villagers are striving to preserve this cultural symbol. Handcrafted (27) ________ lá continue to charm domestic and foreign tourists alike.",
      "readingText": "Nestled along the Day River in Hanoi, Chuong village has long been celebrated for its exquisite conical palm hats, or nón lá. Local artisans have passed down their delicate craftsmanship through countless generations. Crafting a high-quality conical hat demands intricate skill: selecting pale green young palm leaves, ironing them flat with hot charcoal irons, and stitching them with nylon thread onto sixteen circular bamboo hoops. Despite the influx of modern caps and sunhats, young villagers are striving to preserve this cultural symbol. Handcrafted nón lá continue to charm domestic and foreign tourists alike.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nNestled along the Day River in Hanoi, Chuong village has long (23) ________ celebrated for its exquisite conical palm hats, or nón lá. Local artisans have passed down their delicate (24) ________ through countless generations. Crafting a high-quality conical hat demands intricate skill: selecting pale green young palm leaves, ironing (25) ________ flat with hot charcoal irons, and stitching them with nylon thread onto sixteen circular bamboo hoops. Despite (26) ________ influx of modern caps and sunhats, young villagers are striving to preserve this cultural symbol. Handcrafted (27) ________ lá continue to charm domestic and foreign tourists alike.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNestled along the Day River in Hanoi, Chuong village has long been celebrated for its exquisite conical palm hats, or nón lá. Local artisans have passed down their delicate craftsmanship through countless generations. Crafting a high-quality conical hat demands intricate skill: selecting pale green young palm leaves, ironing them flat with hot charcoal irons, and stitching them with nylon thread onto sixteen circular bamboo hoops. Despite the influx of modern caps and sunhats, young villagers are striving to preserve this cultural symbol. Handcrafted nón lá continue to charm domestic and foreign tourists alike.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Name and location of the village; The historical craft practiced (pottery, silk, conical hats); Artisanal techniques used; Challenges faced and modern preservation efforts.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
