      "audioScript": "Phong: \"Hi Lan! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLan: \"Hello Phong! I am preparing a short talk about Navigating the Complexities of Modern Urban Life.\"\nPhong: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLan: \"Sure! Metropolitan life presents modern city dwellers with both exhilarating opportunities and formidable daily challenges.\"\nPhong: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLan: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Metropolitan life presents modern city dwellers with both exhilarating opportunities (23) ________ formidable daily challenges. Mega-cities like Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City feature gleaming skyscrapers, sprawling commercial (24) ________, and rapid transit sky-train networks. However, rapid urban expansion has exacerbated chronic traffic congestion, elevated noise (25) ________, and atmospheric pollution during rush hours. The exorbitant cost of housing and daily commodities also places (26) ________ psychological strain on working families. Urban planners must balance economic modernisation with environmental sustainability (27) ________ green public parks to ensure high living standards.",
      "readingText": "Metropolitan life presents modern city dwellers with both exhilarating opportunities and formidable daily challenges. Mega-cities like Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City feature gleaming skyscrapers, sprawling commercial plazas, and rapid transit sky-train networks. However, rapid urban expansion has exacerbated chronic traffic congestion, elevated noise levels, and atmospheric pollution during rush hours. The exorbitant cost of housing and daily commodities also places immense psychological strain on working families. Urban planners must balance economic modernisation with environmental sustainability and green public parks to ensure high living standards.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nMetropolitan life presents modern city dwellers with both exhilarating opportunities (23) ________ formidable daily challenges. Mega-cities like Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City feature gleaming skyscrapers, sprawling commercial (24) ________, and rapid transit sky-train networks. However, rapid urban expansion has exacerbated chronic traffic congestion, elevated noise (25) ________, and atmospheric pollution during rush hours. The exorbitant cost of housing and daily commodities also places (26) ________ psychological strain on working families. Urban planners must balance economic modernisation with environmental sustainability (27) ________ green public parks to ensure high living standards.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMetropolitan life presents modern city dwellers with both exhilarating opportunities and formidable daily challenges. Mega-cities like Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City feature gleaming skyscrapers, sprawling commercial plazas, and rapid transit sky-train networks. However, rapid urban expansion has exacerbated chronic traffic congestion, elevated noise levels, and atmospheric pollution during rush hours. The exorbitant cost of housing and daily commodities also places immense psychological strain on working families. Urban planners must balance economic modernisation with environmental sustainability and green public parks to ensure high living standards.",
