      "clozeText": "Grade 9 constitutes an exceptionally stressful academic milestone as (23) ________ prepare for high-stakes high school entrance examinations. The relentless deluge of revision assignments, combined with (24) ________ ambitions and fear of academic failure, often triggers severe teenage burnout. Mental health specialists emphasize that (25) ________ wellbeing is just as critical as academic grades. Students should maintain consistent sleep schedules, practice (26) ________ meditation, and engage in regular aerobic exercise. When feeling overwhelmed, reaching out to (27) ________ teachers or school counsellors provides vital emotional grounding.",
      "readingText": "Grade 9 constitutes an exceptionally stressful academic milestone as students prepare for high-stakes high school entrance examinations. The relentless deluge of revision assignments, combined with parental ambitions and fear of academic failure, often triggers severe teenage burnout. Mental health specialists emphasize that emotional wellbeing is just as critical as academic grades. Students should maintain consistent sleep schedules, practice mindful meditation, and engage in regular aerobic exercise. When feeling overwhelmed, reaching out to empathetic teachers or school counsellors provides vital emotional grounding.",
