      "audioScript": "Peter: \"Hi An! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nAn: \"Hello Peter! I am preparing a short talk about Smart Transport Solutions for Megacity Traffic.\"\nPeter: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nAn: \"Sure! Traffic paralysis during morning and evening rush hours has become a defining characteristic of major urban centers.\"\nPeter: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nAn: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Traffic paralysis during morning and evening rush hours has (23) ________ a defining characteristic of major urban centers. To combat gridlock, municipal authorities have invested heavily in (24) ________ sky-train lines and underground metro systems. Modern electric buses powered by lithium batteries have also (25) ________ introduced to reduce tailpipe emissions along major traffic corridors. Commuters are increasingly urged to embrace public (26) ________ and park-and-ride facilities instead of relying on personal motorbikes. Developing integrated, multimodal transit (27) ________ is essential for creating liveable and green cities.",
