      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_gk1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "David: \"Hi Huong! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nHuong: \"Hello David! I am preparing a short talk about Coping with Exam Anxiety and Academic Burnout.\"\nDavid: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nHuong: \"Sure! Exam anxiety is an acute psychological distress reaction that can paralyze even exceptionally capable students during testing.\"\nDavid: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nHuong: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Exam anxiety is an acute psychological distress reaction that (23) ________ paralyze even exceptionally capable students during testing. Symptoms range from rapid heart palpitations and cold (24) ________ to cognitive mental blocks where memorized formulas suddenly vanish. Psychologists advise adopting cognitive reframing techniques, (25) ________ exams as opportunities to demonstrate progress rather than catastrophic judgments of personal worth. Structured (26) ________ schedules that incorporate regular fifteen-minute physical activity breaks prevent cognitive exhaustion. A calm, well-rested (27) ________ performs incomparably better than an exhausted one.",
      "readingText": "Exam anxiety is an acute psychological distress reaction that can paralyze even exceptionally capable students during testing. Symptoms range from rapid heart palpitations and cold perspiration to cognitive mental blocks where memorized formulas suddenly vanish. Psychologists advise adopting cognitive reframing techniques, viewing exams as opportunities to demonstrate progress rather than catastrophic judgments of personal worth. Structured revision schedules that incorporate regular fifteen-minute physical activity breaks prevent cognitive exhaustion. A calm, well-rested mind performs incomparably better than an exhausted one.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExam anxiety is an acute psychological distress reaction that (23) ________ paralyze even exceptionally capable students during testing. Symptoms range from rapid heart palpitations and cold (24) ________ to cognitive mental blocks where memorized formulas suddenly vanish. Psychologists advise adopting cognitive reframing techniques, (25) ________ exams as opportunities to demonstrate progress rather than catastrophic judgments of personal worth. Structured (26) ________ schedules that incorporate regular fifteen-minute physical activity breaks prevent cognitive exhaustion. A calm, well-rested (27) ________ performs incomparably better than an exhausted one.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nExam anxiety is an acute psychological distress reaction that can paralyze even exceptionally capable students during testing. Symptoms range from rapid heart palpitations and cold perspiration to cognitive mental blocks where memorized formulas suddenly vanish. Psychologists advise adopting cognitive reframing techniques, viewing exams as opportunities to demonstrate progress rather than catastrophic judgments of personal worth. Structured revision schedules that incorporate regular fifteen-minute physical activity breaks prevent cognitive exhaustion. A calm, well-rested mind performs incomparably better than an exhausted one.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Specific community workers (sanitation collectors, police officers, firefighters); Difficulties and hazards they face; Why society must show deep respect and gratitude.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
