      "audioScript": "Ben: \"Hi Trang! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nTrang: \"Hello Ben! I am preparing a short talk about The Sky-Train Revolution in Hanoi.\"\nBen: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nTrang: \"Sure! The inauguration of Hanoi's elevated Cat Linh - Ha Dong sky-train line marked a historic milestone in the modernization of municipal public transit.\"\nBen: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nTrang: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "The inauguration of Hanoi's elevated Cat Linh - Ha (23) ________ sky-train line marked a historic milestone in the modernization of municipal public transit. Operating on (24) ________ electrical railways elevated high above congested street-level traffic, the sky-train transports tens of thousands of (25) ________ smoothly across twelve stations daily. Commuters enjoy air-conditioned carriages, panoramic elevated views of the (26) ________, and punctual travel times immune to road traffic jams. Expanding additional metro lines across (27) ________ capital will fundamentally transform urban travel culture.",
      "readingText": "The inauguration of Hanoi's elevated Cat Linh - Ha Dong sky-train line marked a historic milestone in the modernization of municipal public transit. Operating on automated electrical railways elevated high above congested street-level traffic, the sky-train transports tens of thousands of passengers smoothly across twelve stations daily. Commuters enjoy air-conditioned carriages, panoramic elevated views of the city, and punctual travel times immune to road traffic jams. Expanding additional metro lines across the capital will fundamentally transform urban travel culture.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nThe inauguration of Hanoi's elevated Cat Linh - Ha (23) ________ sky-train line marked a historic milestone in the modernization of municipal public transit. Operating on (24) ________ electrical railways elevated high above congested street-level traffic, the sky-train transports tens of thousands of (25) ________ smoothly across twelve stations daily. Commuters enjoy air-conditioned carriages, panoramic elevated views of the (26) ________, and punctual travel times immune to road traffic jams. Expanding additional metro lines across (27) ________ capital will fundamentally transform urban travel culture.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe inauguration of Hanoi's elevated Cat Linh - Ha Dong sky-train line marked a historic milestone in the modernization of municipal public transit. Operating on automated electrical railways elevated high above congested street-level traffic, the sky-train transports tens of thousands of passengers smoothly across twelve stations daily. Commuters enjoy air-conditioned carriages, panoramic elevated views of the city, and punctual travel times immune to road traffic jams. Expanding additional metro lines across the capital will fundamentally transform urban travel culture.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Main sources of urban noise (traffic horns, construction, commercial speakers); Detrimental impacts on physical and mental health; Architectural and legal solutions.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
