      "audioScript": "Phong: \"Hi Lan! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nLan: \"Hello Phong! I am preparing a short talk about Bat Trang Ceramic Village and International Trade.\"\nPhong: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nLan: \"Sure! Bat Trang ceramic village has continually demonstrated remarkable commercial agility, exporting exquisite porcelain and ceramic tableware to dozens of countries across Europe, Japan, and America.\"\nPhong: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nLan: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Bat Trang ceramic village has continually demonstrated remarkable commercial (23) ________, exporting exquisite porcelain and ceramic tableware to dozens of countries across Europe, Japan, and (24) ________. While honoring traditional wood-fired kilns and classical celadon glazes, village factories have embraced modern gas-fueled (25) ________ and computer-aided ceramic design. Young artisan entrepreneurs have opened interactive ceramic workshops and chic (26) ________ cafes along the riverbank, attracting enthusiastic international tourists. Bat Trang proves that traditional (27) ________ can thrive vibrantly in the global economy.",
      "readingText": "Bat Trang ceramic village has continually demonstrated remarkable commercial agility, exporting exquisite porcelain and ceramic tableware to dozens of countries across Europe, Japan, and America. While honoring traditional wood-fired kilns and classical celadon glazes, village factories have embraced modern gas-fueled kilns and computer-aided ceramic design. Young artisan entrepreneurs have opened interactive ceramic workshops and chic pottery cafes along the riverbank, attracting enthusiastic international tourists. Bat Trang proves that traditional crafts can thrive vibrantly in the global economy.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nBat Trang ceramic village has continually demonstrated remarkable commercial (23) ________, exporting exquisite porcelain and ceramic tableware to dozens of countries across Europe, Japan, and (24) ________. While honoring traditional wood-fired kilns and classical celadon glazes, village factories have embraced modern gas-fueled (25) ________ and computer-aided ceramic design. Young artisan entrepreneurs have opened interactive ceramic workshops and chic (26) ________ cafes along the riverbank, attracting enthusiastic international tourists. Bat Trang proves that traditional (27) ________ can thrive vibrantly in the global economy.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBat Trang ceramic village has continually demonstrated remarkable commercial agility, exporting exquisite porcelain and ceramic tableware to dozens of countries across Europe, Japan, and America. While honoring traditional wood-fired kilns and classical celadon glazes, village factories have embraced modern gas-fueled kilns and computer-aided ceramic design. Young artisan entrepreneurs have opened interactive ceramic workshops and chic pottery cafes along the riverbank, attracting enthusiastic international tourists. Bat Trang proves that traditional crafts can thrive vibrantly in the global economy.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Dangers of addictive scrolling and algorithmic manipulation; Comparing oneself to curated profiles (FOMO); Practical digital detox habits; Protecting mental peace.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
