      "clozeText": "Social media applications offer incredible connectivity, but unmindful scrolling (23) ________ quickly hijack teenage attention spans and fuel toxic comparison culture. Viewing curated digital reels (24) ________ glamorous vacations and unrealistic physical appearances often induces deep inadequacy and FOMO (fear of missing (25) ________). Mental health professionals urge teens to practice digital minimalism: turning off non-essential notifications, curating inspirational (26) ________, and scheduling weekly digital detox days. Reclaiming control over your attention is the (27) ________ act of self-care in a hyper-connected world.",
