      "audioScript": "Ben: \"Hi Trang! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nTrang: \"Hello Ben! I am preparing a short talk about Tho Ha Ancient Pottery and Rice Paper Village.\"\nBen: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nTrang: \"Sure! Tho Ha village in Bac Giang boasts a venerable history spanning centuries of traditional craftsmanship.\"\nBen: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nTrang: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Tho Ha village in Bac Giang boasts a venerable (23) ________ spanning centuries of traditional craftsmanship. Originally famed for its unglazed terracotta pottery, the village ingeniously transitioned (24) ________ producing premium dry rice paper (bánh đa nem) as consumer tastes evolved. Narrow village brick alleyways (25) ________ lined with walls constructed entirely from broken pottery shards and terracotta kiln remnants. During sunny (26) ________, thousands of bamboo drying racks holding translucent rice paper cover courtyards and river dykes. (27) ________ Ha exemplifies remarkable cultural resilience and industrial reinvention.",
      "readingText": "Tho Ha village in Bac Giang boasts a venerable history spanning centuries of traditional craftsmanship. Originally famed for its unglazed terracotta pottery, the village ingeniously transitioned into producing premium dry rice paper (bánh đa nem) as consumer tastes evolved. Narrow village brick alleyways are lined with walls constructed entirely from broken pottery shards and terracotta kiln remnants. During sunny days, thousands of bamboo drying racks holding translucent rice paper cover courtyards and river dykes. Tho Ha exemplifies remarkable cultural resilience and industrial reinvention.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTho Ha village in Bac Giang boasts a venerable (23) ________ spanning centuries of traditional craftsmanship. Originally famed for its unglazed terracotta pottery, the village ingeniously transitioned (24) ________ producing premium dry rice paper (bánh đa nem) as consumer tastes evolved. Narrow village brick alleyways (25) ________ lined with walls constructed entirely from broken pottery shards and terracotta kiln remnants. During sunny (26) ________, thousands of bamboo drying racks holding translucent rice paper cover courtyards and river dykes. (27) ________ Ha exemplifies remarkable cultural resilience and industrial reinvention.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTho Ha village in Bac Giang boasts a venerable history spanning centuries of traditional craftsmanship. Originally famed for its unglazed terracotta pottery, the village ingeniously transitioned into producing premium dry rice paper (bánh đa nem) as consumer tastes evolved. Narrow village brick alleyways are lined with walls constructed entirely from broken pottery shards and terracotta kiln remnants. During sunny days, thousands of bamboo drying racks holding translucent rice paper cover courtyards and river dykes. Tho Ha exemplifies remarkable cultural resilience and industrial reinvention.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): De-stigmatizing mental healthcare; Safe, confidential environment to discuss anxiety and family stress; Practical coping tools gained; Courage in seeking help.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
