      "audioScript": "Nam: \"Hi Mai! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nMai: \"Hello Nam! I am preparing a short talk about The Psychological Impact of Long Commutes in Cities.\"\nNam: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nMai: \"Sure! Spending two to three hours daily trapped in gridlocked urban traffic exacts a heavy toll on metropolitan workers and students.\"\nNam: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nMai: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Spending two to three hours daily trapped in gridlocked (23) ________ traffic exacts a heavy toll on metropolitan workers and students. Protracted commuting through polluted (24) ________ fumes elevates cortisol stress hormones, triggers chronic lumbar back pain, and steals precious hours from (25) ________ and family life. Urban sociologists emphasize that long commutes diminish civic happiness and strain (26) ________ relationships. Developing telecommuting options, mixed-use residential zones, and reliable mass rapid transit is (27) ________ for restoring work-life equilibrium in modern society.",
