      "audioScript": "Mark: \"Hi Hoa! What are you working on for our English group presentation?\"\nHoa: \"Hello Mark! I am preparing a short talk about Managing Time Effectively in Secondary School.\"\nMark: \"That sounds very interesting! Can you share one important detail about it?\"\nHoa: \"Sure! Balancing academic requirements, domestic chores, and extracurricular pursuits requires secondary students to master disciplined time-management techniques.\"\nMark: \"I agree completely. It helps students understand more about real-life experiences.\"\nHoa: \"Yes, and we can practice speaking English with confidence during the presentation!\"",
      "clozeText": "Balancing academic requirements, domestic chores, and extracurricular pursuits (23) ________ secondary students to master disciplined time-management techniques. Utilizing the Eisenhower Priority Matrix enables (24) ________ to distinguish between truly important tasks and merely urgent distractions. Breaking daunting long-term (25) ________ into manageable daily increments prevents paralyzing procrastination. Furthermore, designating sacred distraction-free study blocks (26) ________ the Pomodoro technique enhances cognitive focus dramatically. Mastering time management during grade (27) ________ builds lifelong autonomy and career excellence.",
      "readingText": "Balancing academic requirements, domestic chores, and extracurricular pursuits requires secondary students to master disciplined time-management techniques. Utilizing the Eisenhower Priority Matrix enables students to distinguish between truly important tasks and merely urgent distractions. Breaking daunting long-term projects into manageable daily increments prevents paralyzing procrastination. Furthermore, designating sacred distraction-free study blocks using the Pomodoro technique enhances cognitive focus dramatically. Mastering time management during grade 9 builds lifelong autonomy and career excellence.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nBalancing academic requirements, domestic chores, and extracurricular pursuits (23) ________ secondary students to master disciplined time-management techniques. Utilizing the Eisenhower Priority Matrix enables (24) ________ to distinguish between truly important tasks and merely urgent distractions. Breaking daunting long-term (25) ________ into manageable daily increments prevents paralyzing procrastination. Furthermore, designating sacred distraction-free study blocks (26) ________ the Pomodoro technique enhances cognitive focus dramatically. Mastering time management during grade (27) ________ builds lifelong autonomy and career excellence.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBalancing academic requirements, domestic chores, and extracurricular pursuits requires secondary students to master disciplined time-management techniques. Utilizing the Eisenhower Priority Matrix enables students to distinguish between truly important tasks and merely urgent distractions. Breaking daunting long-term projects into manageable daily increments prevents paralyzing procrastination. Furthermore, designating sacred distraction-free study blocks using the Pomodoro technique enhances cognitive focus dramatically. Mastering time management during grade 9 builds lifelong autonomy and career excellence.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Four centuries of imperial metallurgy; Crafting monumental relics like the Nine Dynastic Urns; Technical mastery of molten bronze; Enduring spiritual heritage.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, engaging in productive activities during free time plays a crucial role in teenagers' overall development. First, it provides a healthy balance between rigorous academic studies and physical recreation, helping students alleviate stress. Furthermore, participating in school clubs or community projects broadens practical knowledge and strengthens social bonding. Therefore, choosing meaningful hobbies is essential for a joyful and well-rounded teenage life.",
